eness` instance implies the\nskeleton via the writhe assignment `4, 6, 8`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.weak_spectral_completeness_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.weak_spectral_completeness_holds","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L59-L59","doc":"**The conjecture itself.**  The completeness index is exactly\n$1$: the weak-sector spectrum is fully spanned by the Hoefsmit\nbasis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.completenessIndex_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.completenessIndex_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Completeness index is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.completenessIndex_le_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.completenessIndex_le_one","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Completeness index is in $[0, 1]$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.completenessIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.completenessIndex","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The completeness index: rank of the spanned subspace divided\nby the rank of the weak sector.  Equals $1$ iff the spectrum\nis complete. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.spectralBasis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.spectralBasis","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The basis of the weak-sector spectrum. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness.mk","kind":"ctor","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WeakSpectralCompleteness","kind":"class","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.lean#L40-L59","doc":"**`conj:weak-spectral-completeness` (axiomatised).**\n\nThe spectral basis indexed by Hoefsmit cell-content data spans\nthe weak sector of the Hecke representation. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:weak-spectral-completeness","label":"conj:weak-spectral-completeness","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/weak-spectral-completeness.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}